@*
    KVKK (docs/03_PageBlueprints.md "Page — KVKK"). Title/description/
    canonical/OG/WebPage schema come from ViewData["Seo"] +
    ViewData["SeoPageType"], set in KvkkController.Index via ISeoService —
    see _Layout.cshtml's <head> and SeoStructuredDataViewComponent.

    Page flow (project owner's 2026-08-03 approval): Breadcrumb → Hero
    Banner (Standard, dedicated placeholder image — same "always has its
    own banner" precedent as About Us/Values/HR Policy) → KVKK Policy
    (Introduction + Privacy Policy folded into one document,
    KvkkPolicyViewComponent — see that component's comment for why) →
    Contact Information (Information Card List layout reusing SiteSettings,
    KvkkContactViewComponent). Accordion and Download Button are explicitly
    out of scope per the same approval. Footer / CTA Banner / Floating
    Contact Button are already global (_Layout.cshtml).
*@

@{
    var breadcrumbTrail = new List<AncinInsaat.ViewComponents.BreadcrumbItem>
    {
        new() { Label = "KVKK Aydınlatma Metni" }
    };
}
@await Component.InvokeAsync("Breadcrumb", new { trail = breadcrumbTrail })

@await Component.InvokeAsync("HeroBannerStandard", new
{
    heading = "KVKK Aydınlatma Metni",
    subheading = "Kişisel verilerinizin işlenmesine ilişkin aydınlatma metnimiz.",
    backgroundImageUrl = "/images/hero/kvkk-placeholder.svg"
})

@await Component.InvokeAsync("KvkkPolicy")

@await Component.InvokeAsync("KvkkContact")
